/** ASCII-case-insensitive CSS named colors (draft §4.5). A representative
 *  set — CSS Level 1's 16 keywords plus common Level 3/4 extended names —
 *  rather than the full ~148-name table, to avoid transcribing that many
 *  RGB triples without a way to verify them in this environment. Extending
 *  this table is a mechanical, low-risk follow-up; it does not change the
 *  parsing algorithm. */
